# QingRex mini-program and app lazy ad removal rule layer
# Source module: 小程序和应用懒人去广告合集.official.sgmodule
# Scope: app and mini-program ad domain/IP rejects.
# Fusion safety: non-ad safe-browsing bypass, WeChat HTTPDNS rejects, and Spotify rules are filtered out.
# Rollback: remove qingrex_miniapp_rules from Rewrite/Profiles/fusion.conf and rebuild Fusion.

